DESCRIPTION:Let's have some FUN playing BINGO while enjoying some good R&B\
 , Food\, Drinks and Comedy.\n\nThis is the perfect event to start your nigh
 t or end your night. R&B does something to the soul\, but while playing BIN
 GO creates a VIBE. Our Host\, Wild 'N Out's Darren Brand brings humor while
  narrating the event along with a few of his celebrity friends. Enjoy a goo
 d evening and win some $$$ and prizes.\n\nAfter graduating from North Carol
 ina A&T University\, Brand went on to pursue his dreams of bringing his tal
 ents to the television screen. His first win was landing a role on MTV’s 
 hit series ‘Wild ’N Out’\; he thrived there for over six seasons. The
  self-proclaimed ‘Energy God’ has utilized his platform to open doors f
 or many industry opportunities to follow including writing as a TRL contrib
 utor\, hosting at the BET (pre- and Social) Awards and more. Brand secured 
 his first national commercial project with McDonalds in 2018 and is current
 ly starring in two MTV digital content series. Darren Brand\, known by all 
 as Big Baby has garnered global success across digital platforms with conte
 nt such as\, Basic to Bougie with Wild ’N Out co-stars Timothy Delaghetto
  and Justina Valentine\, as well as Next Big Dance Move featuring fellow ju
 dge’s funnyman Emmanuel Hudson and choreographer Dana Alexa.\n\nCouple's 
 Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 p
 er person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the righ
 t to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive 
 or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-a
 tlas/event/special-event-r-b-bingo-with-darren-brand/
